# README — Representative MD Frames

This directory contains representative equilibrated molecular dynamics snapshots corresponding to the systems analyzed in the manuscript:

"AI-Guided Cardiotoxicity-Aware Fluoroquinolone Redesign via Integrated Docking, Molecular Dynamics, and MM/PBSA Analysis"

The representative frames were selected from equilibrated production trajectories and visually summarize the interaction patterns discussed in the manuscript, including:

* reduced hERG stabilization of FLQ_Mod_2
* weakened Arg541 coupling
* altered Tyr545 aromatic stacking
* preserved Mg²⁺ coordination within DNA gyrase
* retained antibacterial pharmacophore geometry

Representative frames are intended for structural visualization and reproducibility support and do not replace the quantitative analyses reported in the manuscript.

Additional simulation data and replicate trajectories are available from the corresponding author upon reasonable request.
